{"t_ms": 3336234, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s0_044", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Business Centre Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Business Centre is open daily from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM. Facilities include desktop computers, high-speed internet access, printing, scanning, photocopying, and meeting workstations. Guests requiring administrative assistance may request support from the Business Centre staff during operating hours.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Meeting & Conference Rooms\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel offers fully equipped meeting rooms and conference halls suitable for business meetings, training sessions, and corporate events. Facilities include projectors, audio-visual equipment, wireless internet, and customizable seating arrangements. Advance booking is recommended to ensure availability."], "scores": [0.538852334022522, 0.650399923324585, 0.7219996452331543], "filenames": ["44_business_center.txt", "README.md", "45_meeting_rooms.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 31, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
